INTERSTELLAR (experimental interpulse-bias module) enabled for this build.

This tiny marker file is bundled next to the frozen PULSAR executable
ONLY by the opt-in experimental build (`python installer/build.py
--with-interstellar`, which sets the PULSAR_WITH_INTERSTELLAR env var
that installer/StimulationTesting.spec checks).  At runtime,
stimtest.feature_flags.interstellar_enabled() returns True when it finds
this file, so the experimental installer shows the INTERSTELLAR
connector + closed-loop bias UI.

The DEFAULT (public) installer never bundles this file, so a normal
install has no INTERSTELLAR UI at all.  Its contents are irrelevant —
only its presence matters.
